over the quarter.\n\n## Two Caveats\n\n- **Additivity:** as flagged, per-author levels don't sum to the aggregate chart's value (log2 isn't additive). The aggregate shows *total activity*; this chart shows *allocation across people*.\n- **Tagging accuracy:** attribution follows git author, so pairing/squash-merges credit the committer. If the team uses squash-merge, one person may get credit for a collaboratively-built PR.\n\nWant me to add a **stacked area** version (shows share-over-time cleanly) or an **author filter dropdown** to let you isolate one person?"}
